  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/15628/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788782400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/15628-buy-the-blood-of-dawnwalker-pc-steam/",
      "user": "AgX_28",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/20147999-1689877201.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "A very pleasant surprise this game has been. I was actually afraid because I really disliked The Witcher, where the combat was not fun, I didn't care about the story and I thought the main character very dull.\n\n\n\nThe Blood of Dawnwalker has kept me intrigued and eager to continue playing this game, the options you have to make are VERY impactful and you have to choose wisely, the combat is to my surprise very fun to play and Im just playing in normal difficulty with mouse and keyboard is pretty good.\n\n\n\nThe 30 day time mechanic is something innovative (something that has been lacking in gaming) and of course the lame new generation of gamers are complaining about something unique.\n\n\n\n I hope Rebel Wolves patent this mechanic.\n\n\n\nSo far so good 8/10\n\n\n\n-2 due to performance issues"
    },
    {
      "game": "Maneater: Truth Quest",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9403/450x258/maneater-truth-quest-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788782400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9403-buy-maneater-truth-quest-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-b307567",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It's an Very cool DLC If a New Island, New power and the and a boss that was hard web I started but Today Ia dit it in first try\n\nAnd If I Are trying to defeat it wen u reach the 2 stage , run and kill the little green shark because he is the fastest of the other tree, then just kill the monster"
    },
    {
      "game": "Sunset Overdrive",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/608/450x258/sunset-overdrive-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788782400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/608-buy-sunset-overdrive-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Filaraki",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/27591431-1788642190.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Sunset Overdrive (developed by Insomniac Games) is a fast-paced, irreverent open-world action game that fuses the fluid movement of Jet Set Radio with the wacky, explosive arsenal of Ratchet & Clank. Set in a vibrant post-apocalyptic city over-run by energy-drink mutants, its gameplay revolves entirely around maintaining momentum by grinding, wall-running, and bouncing across the skyline while firing outrageous weapons\n\n\n\nVerdict: 8/10 — A cult-classic action sandbox that delivers pure, unadulterated fun. Just grab a gamepad to play it on PC"
    },
    {
      "game": "LEGO The Hobbit",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/345/450x258/lego-the-hobbit-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1788782400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/345-buy-lego-the-hobbit-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Filaraki",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/27591431-1788642190.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "LEGO The Hobbit builds on the open-world formula of LEGO The Lord of the Rings with polished mechanics like dwarf \"buddy-up\" attacks and resource crafting. However, it is fundamentally held back by a major structural flaw: it only covers the first two films (An Unexpected Journey and The Desolation of Smaug). The planned DLC for the third film was canceled, leaving the narrative permanently unfinished\n\n\n\nVerdict: 6.5/10 — Fun gameplay and detailed environments, but the permanent lack of the third movie's story makes it hard to recommend over LEGO Lord of the Rings."
    }
  ],
